Read-only audit of /Users/sashaabramovich/live-spec. Do NOT edit. Return ≤650 words: ledger rows in EXACTLY this format, citing SOURCE (file + heading + line):
`capability | canonical owner | anchor | input | output | boundary ("does not do") | invocation/route | proof | state(working/partial/prose-only/stale)`

Domain: design-reviewer. Read skills/design-reviewer/SKILL.md (429 lines), PRODUCT_SPEC.md Req 69 area (~L1624-1700), TEST_MATRIX rows citing design-review (M-284 etc.), docs/design-review/ (count records, newest date). Cover as separate rows:
1. **the same-kind groups lens**: find its exact heading/wording — what "same-kind" grouping it proposes, over what input, and what it emits. Quote the defining sentence + line;
2. **the behaviour-parity recommendation lens**: exact heading/wording — what parity it recommends and in what form. Quote + line;
3. the confidence read (confident/likely) — definition line and how findings carry it;
4. review cadence (when it fires in the pipeline — build-pipeline SKILL.md cadence line);
5. findings-never-block law (spec line);
6. the findings ratchet / doc-findings-bound gate aa relation if any.
CRITICAL: state precisely how lenses 1-2 differ from the product-prover's class/lookalike factual-defect sweep — cite both sources if the wording overlaps. Boundary column must say what design-reviewer does NOT do (does not fix, does not block, does not sweep for factual defects?). Flag capabilities described but never mechanically invoked; duplicate authorities. Proof: real tests or "none".
